WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.856
Pinocchio ran to the ocean.

2
00:00:13.857 --> 00:00:18.098
Because he had worked at the orphanage, he was very strong.

3
00:00:18.099 --> 00:00:20.587
He swam through the waves easily.

4
00:00:20.588 --> 00:00:25.360
He swam so fast, he was able to swim with some dolphins.

5
00:00:25.361 --> 00:00:28.518
"Hello, dolphins!" Pinocchio called.

6
00:00:28.519 --> 00:00:31.061
"I am looking for a large whale.

7
00:00:31.062 --> 00:00:33.455
Do you know where I can find it?"

8
00:00:33.456 --> 00:00:38.415
"Yeah, yeah, yeah," the dolphins said.

9
00:00:38.416 --> 00:00:40.913
They swam a big circle around him.

10
00:00:40.914 --> 00:00:44.632
One dolphin came below Pinocchio to help him swim deeper.

11
00:00:44.633 --> 00:00:47.540
The dolphins swam off in a new direction.

12
00:00:47.541 --> 00:00:49.710
Pinocchio held on tightly.

13
00:00:49.711 --> 00:00:54.972
"Whee, this is fun!" he shouted through the bubbles.

14
00:00:54.973 --> 00:00:57.591
The dolphins dove deeper and deeper.

15
00:00:57.592 --> 00:01:00.346
Pinocchio could see something very big ahead.

16
00:01:00.347 --> 00:01:02.603
It looked like a big blue house.

17
00:01:02.604 --> 00:01:03.980
It was the whale!

18
00:01:03.981 --> 00:01:06.802
The dolphins swam near the whale.

19
00:01:06.803 --> 00:01:10.167
"Hi, big whale!" they called.

20
00:01:10.168 --> 00:01:13.928
"Hello," the whale called back.

21
00:01:13.929 --> 00:01:20.200
When the whale opened its mouth to say hello, Pinocchio jumped inside.

22
00:01:20.201 --> 00:01:22.479
"It's so dark in here!"

23
00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:26.693
Pinocchio said, walking carefully along the whale's teeth.

24
00:01:26.694 --> 00:01:29.162
"It's nice and warm though."

25
00:01:29.163 --> 00:01:37.967
He walked deep into the whale's throat.

26
00:01:37.968 --> 00:01:43.507
As Pinocchio got closer to the whale's stomach, he noticed a bad smell.

27
00:01:43.508 --> 00:01:48.473
"Oh, that's gross!" he said. "What smells so bad?"

28
00:01:48.474 --> 00:01:50.365
"I do," said a voice.

29
00:01:50.366 --> 00:01:53.471
"Father?" Pinocchio called.

30
00:01:53.472 --> 00:01:57.744
"Pinocchio, is that you?" Geppetto called back.

31
00:01:57.745 --> 00:02:02.449
Even though they were inside a smelly fish, they had never been happier.

32
00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:07.152
They ran across the whale's stomach and held each other.

33
00:02:07.153 --> 00:02:10.219
"Oh, Father. You are very thin.

34
00:02:10.220 --> 00:02:13.597
I am sorry it took me so long to find you.

35
00:02:13.598 --> 00:02:16.875
Please forgive me," Pinocchio said.

36
00:02:16.876 --> 00:02:20.085
"Pinocchio, how did you find me?

37
00:02:20.086 --> 00:02:22.029
I had given up hope.

38
00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:26.350
I thought you were lost too," said Geppetto.

39
00:02:26.351 --> 00:02:30.945
They both had many questions to ask and even more stories to tell.

40
00:02:30.946 --> 00:02:33.396
But the whale was swimming deeper.

41
00:02:33.397 --> 00:02:38.154
"Father, we must get out of this whale quickly," said Pinocchio.

42
00:02:38.155 --> 00:02:41.491
"It is no use," said Geppetto.

43
00:02:41.492 --> 00:02:47.181
"I have tried many times, but the whale will not open its mouth."

44
00:02:47.182 --> 00:02:49.891
Pinocchio remembered the story of Jonah.

45
00:02:49.892 --> 00:02:52.209
The whale had spit Jonah out.

46
00:02:52.210 --> 00:02:54.952
How could Pinocchio make this whale spit them out?

47
00:02:54.953 --> 00:02:56.924
Suddenly, he had an idea.

48
00:02:56.925 --> 00:03:00.442
"Father, climb with me up to the whale's mouth.

49
00:03:00.443 --> 00:03:02.944
Here, I will help you."

50
00:03:02.945 --> 00:03:07.095
Together, the two climbed up and sat on the whale's teeth.

51
00:03:07.096 --> 00:03:12.027
"Can you reach up and tickle the top of the whale's mouth?" Pinocchio asked.

52
00:03:12.028 --> 00:03:15.574
"I can try," answered Geppetto.

53
00:03:15.575 --> 00:03:18.536
He stood very tall and tickled the whale.

54
00:03:18.537 --> 00:03:20.980
The whale started to swim up very quickly.

55
00:03:20.981 --> 00:03:23.613
Its tongue started to jump.

56
00:03:23.614 --> 00:03:31.257
"Ahh-ahh-choo!" the whale said, and it sneezed them onto the sand.

57
00:03:31.258 --> 00:03:35.667
"Hooray, we made it!" cheered Pinocchio.

58
00:03:35.668 --> 00:03:39.936
"Oh, you are so smart, son!" said Geppetto.

59
00:03:39.937 --> 00:03:43.447
"How did you know to tickle the whale?"

60
00:03:43.448 --> 00:03:49.695
"I got the idea from something I learned at a school," Pinocchio said, smiling.

61
00:03:49.696 --> 00:03:53.925
Just then, the whale began to slide up onto the sand and speak.

62
00:03:53.926 --> 00:03:56.684
Its voice was soft and pretty.

63
00:03:56.685 --> 00:04:00.213
"Well done, Pinocchio," it said.

64
00:04:00.214 --> 00:04:03.938
"You have proven yourself to be a good boy.

65
00:04:03.939 --> 00:04:06.397
You have honored your father.

66
00:04:06.398 --> 00:04:09.882
You have been obedient and generous.

67
00:04:09.883 --> 00:04:13.418
You have risked your life to save him."

68
00:04:13.419 --> 00:04:15.348
Suddenly, the whale vanished.

69
00:04:15.349 --> 00:04:18.190
In its place stood the Blue Fairy.

70
00:04:18.191 --> 00:04:24.140
"Blue Fairy! You were the whale?" Pinocchio asked, very surprised.

71
00:04:24.141 --> 00:04:30.300
"Yes. I kept Geppetto safe until you learned to be a good boy.

72
00:04:30.301 --> 00:04:34.780
Farewell, gentlemen. I wish you a happy life together,"

73
00:04:34.781 --> 00:04:40.265
she said, and the Blue Fairy flew away.

74
00:04:40.266 --> 00:04:42.632
Pinocchio and Geppetto waved good-bye.

75
00:04:42.633 --> 00:04:45.663
As Pinocchio waved, he looked at his hand.

76
00:04:45.664 --> 00:04:48.892
It was the hand of a real boy.

77
00:04:48.893 --> 00:04:53.097
"Ah! I'm a real boy! Father, look!

78
00:04:53.098 --> 00:04:56.087
I'm really real!" he cried.

79
00:04:56.088 --> 00:05:08.982
Father and son laughed and hugged and danced all the way home.

80
00:05:08.983 --> 00:05:48.564
[caption_out@
